1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,480
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:12,083
Five packs of Seven Stars.

3
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:14,125
We don't sell Seven Stars.

4
00:00:14,208 --> 00:00:15,375
Ten packs of Seven Stars.

5
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:17,000
Is seven packs okay?

6
00:00:17,083 --> 00:00:18,291
Two packs are enough.

7
00:00:24,791 --> 00:00:27,083
Hey, stop!

8
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,125
You said you didn't steal.

9
00:00:31,208 --> 00:00:32,541
So why did you run so fast?

10
00:00:32,625 --> 00:00:35,625
Who knew what you wanted to do? Why did you falsely accuse me?

11
00:00:35,708 --> 00:00:37,791
You were being shady. I had my eye on you.

12
00:00:37,875 --> 00:00:40,125
Aunt, just now I saw that he--

13
00:00:40,625 --> 00:00:41,958
Are you blind?

14
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,375
Go watch the door.

15
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:45,916
What?

16
00:00:48,208 --> 00:00:49,791
I only found 200 bucks on him.

17
00:00:54,875 --> 00:00:56,333
What are you looking at?

18
00:00:56,416 --> 00:00:57,708
You can't even keep watch.

19
00:00:57,791 --> 00:00:59,541
What a waste of money raising you was.

20
00:01:00,125 --> 00:01:02,875
If your mom hadn't died, who would've taken on a burden like you?

21
00:01:02,958 --> 00:01:05,083
That deadpan face of yours just annoys me.

22
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:13,708
Hey.

23
00:01:14,875 --> 00:01:17,583
I know you're coming back for it after closing.

24
00:01:21,458 --> 00:01:23,208
I took 3,000 bucks as my commission.

25
00:01:36,083 --> 00:01:38,625
Where are you? Did you vanish while on watch?

26
00:01:39,208 --> 00:01:41,875
I went to the store. Didn't your side piece want food?

27
00:01:41,958 --> 00:01:43,208
Do you have a death wish?

28
00:01:43,291 --> 00:01:44,666
Watch your mouth.

29
00:01:44,750 --> 00:01:46,166
Get your ass back here now.

30
00:02:48,958 --> 00:02:50,625
Make a sound, and you'll die.

31
00:03:16,083 --> 00:03:18,250
THE FIXERS

32
00:03:19,541 --> 00:03:22,916
DOG EAT DOG

33
00:03:49,166 --> 00:03:50,541
Madam Fan is asking for me.

34
00:04:04,458 --> 00:04:06,333
Dead or vanished,

35
00:04:07,166 --> 00:04:09,208
the client doesn't care,

36
00:04:09,958 --> 00:04:12,291
as long as it is taken care of.

37
00:04:12,375 --> 00:04:13,541
Okay.

38
00:04:20,333 --> 00:04:21,250
Madam Fan.

39
00:04:24,791 --> 00:04:27,833
I heard it was an older man and a younger man.

40
00:04:28,416 --> 00:04:31,666
Yes. They had the same goal as us.

41
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:36,458
Maybe there was a problem on the client's end.

42
00:04:36,541 --> 00:04:37,458
I'll handle it.

43
00:04:39,125 --> 00:04:41,833
Something was taken from me during the mission.

44
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:44,125
I want to get it back.

45
00:04:54,916 --> 00:04:56,375
Your necklace.

46
00:04:56,458 --> 00:04:58,083
Who was it from?

47
00:04:59,833 --> 00:05:02,166
I've never seen you without it.

48
00:05:02,250 --> 00:05:03,291
Who was it from?

49
00:05:05,250 --> 00:05:07,583
It's the only thing my family left me.

50
00:05:12,041 --> 00:05:13,916
All the more reason to get it back.

51
00:05:17,041 --> 00:05:18,416
Go home first.

52
00:05:19,041 --> 00:05:21,875
Wait until you hear from me before you act on the case.

53
00:05:21,958 --> 00:05:22,791
Okay.

54
00:06:13,958 --> 00:06:15,000
Tai.

55
00:06:24,791 --> 00:06:27,041
Tai, the director general is done picking.

56
00:06:43,208 --> 00:06:47,708
X: DID YOU DELETE ALL THE VIDEOS ON YOUR END?

57
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,416
Next, the tragedy that has shocked the entertainment industry.

58
00:06:54,500 --> 00:06:56,750
An explicit video of pop star Sheng went viral.

59
00:06:56,833 --> 00:06:58,541
FIXER GOLD

60
00:06:58,625 --> 00:06:59,750
Stop it.

61
00:06:59,833 --> 00:07:01,291
…was used to dox her…

62
00:07:01,375 --> 00:07:02,750
Sweet and sour ribs again?

63
00:07:03,250 --> 00:07:04,916
However, it appears she struggled…

64
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,791
Didn't I tell you to call me instead of showing up at my office?

65
00:07:09,375 --> 00:07:10,750
But you didn't answer my call.

66
00:07:10,833 --> 00:07:12,583
I'm a poor dad, man. Gotta make money.

67
00:07:12,666 --> 00:07:13,916
No time for your calls.

68
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,416
Why are we seeing this four-eyes?

69
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,541
Sir, who are you?

70
00:07:16,625 --> 00:07:19,000
Wear your reading glasses, or your eyes will go bad.

71
00:07:19,083 --> 00:07:19,916
I don't need them.

72
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,083
I need you to look into a few scumbags for us.

73
00:07:22,166 --> 00:07:24,791
Can't you wait till I get off work and take my kid home?

74
00:07:24,875 --> 00:07:27,041
Dude, what time do you get off work?

75
00:07:27,125 --> 00:07:29,166
We need the case closed tomorrow.

76
00:07:29,250 --> 00:07:31,375
That will be tough. I want a 40% cut.

77
00:07:31,458 --> 00:07:33,125
Damn. Are you exploiting us?

78
00:07:33,708 --> 00:07:35,416
Dude, raising a kid costs a lot.

79
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:36,916
And I need laser eye surgery.

80
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,333
Fine, 40%.

81
00:07:38,416 --> 00:07:39,291
Hold on.

82
00:07:39,375 --> 00:07:41,083
Fuck, you have a kid, and I don't?

83
00:07:41,166 --> 00:07:42,666
40% is so steep.

84
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,625
It's coming from your portion.

85
00:07:44,708 --> 00:07:47,083
I want you to look into this account called Tai.

86
00:07:47,166 --> 00:07:49,916
Sheng asked him via DM if the videos were deleted.

87
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,833
That means he has Sheng's self-recorded videos.

88
00:07:52,916 --> 00:07:53,875
Maybe he leaked them.

89
00:07:56,541 --> 00:07:58,125
Shit.

90
00:07:58,208 --> 00:08:00,083
My manager is calling. Time to code.

91
00:08:00,166 --> 00:08:02,125
Hey, help me clean up.

92
00:08:02,833 --> 00:08:04,000
I'll tell you what I find.

93
00:08:06,541 --> 00:08:07,583
I'll pay the 40%.

94
00:08:07,666 --> 00:08:08,500
You clean up.

95
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,833
Fuck, talk about being damn broke.

96
00:08:11,625 --> 00:08:14,333
He got a drink and didn't even touch it.

97
00:08:21,041 --> 00:08:21,958
Hey.

98
00:08:31,041 --> 00:08:33,000
I have two questions for you.

99
00:08:33,083 --> 00:08:34,791
Why do you have so many questions?

100
00:08:35,875 --> 00:08:36,708
What?

101
00:08:36,791 --> 00:08:40,083
We've already deleted Ms. Yen's daughter's videos.

102
00:08:40,166 --> 00:08:41,791
Why are we still investigating?

103
00:08:41,875 --> 00:08:43,791
Sheng's videos still got leaked.

104
00:08:44,291 --> 00:08:46,416
We have to find out who posted them.

105
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,333
Okay.

106
00:08:47,833 --> 00:08:50,458
Teach the scumbag a lesson.

107
00:08:53,583 --> 00:08:56,666
That four-eyes won't find anything this soon, right?

108
00:08:58,083 --> 00:09:00,625
Fixer Stealth is Ching He's best intelligence support.

109
00:09:00,708 --> 00:09:01,708
What?

110
00:09:02,333 --> 00:09:04,291
Slacking off on your first mission already?

111
00:09:04,375 --> 00:09:06,041
No.

112
00:09:06,125 --> 00:09:09,583
My son just finished his midterms.

113
00:09:09,666 --> 00:09:11,916
I promised to treat him to a nice meal tonight.

114
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,958
It's okay. We can have it another day.

115
00:09:14,041 --> 00:09:16,083
Where are we heading next? Let's roll.

116
00:09:18,166 --> 00:09:20,291
He probably won't find anything this soon.

117
00:09:20,791 --> 00:09:21,791
Go ahead.

118
00:09:23,291 --> 00:09:24,916
Are you messing with me?

119
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,708
Hey, it's not that easy to lose me, all right?

120
00:09:27,791 --> 00:09:29,791
Hey, keep your phone on.

121
00:09:29,875 --> 00:09:31,750
Be ready once we get the intel. Got it?

122
00:09:32,333 --> 00:09:34,041
Fee-fi-fo-fum!

123
00:09:35,708 --> 00:09:36,666
Thank you.

124
00:09:38,916 --> 00:09:41,333
Hey, what was your second question?

125
00:09:41,416 --> 00:09:44,291
What comes after "Roses are red, violets are blue"?

126
00:09:44,375 --> 00:09:47,125
"I'll take you down a peg or two," fool!

127
00:09:47,625 --> 00:09:49,666
SWAMP EEL NOODLES

128
00:09:50,583 --> 00:09:51,958
What's with the feast?

129
00:09:52,041 --> 00:09:53,250
My son came in first.

130
00:09:53,333 --> 00:09:54,333
We gotta celebrate.

131
00:09:56,208 --> 00:09:57,041
Amazing.

132
00:09:57,541 --> 00:09:59,083
-Great job. -Thank you.

133
00:09:59,166 --> 00:10:01,833
It's just midterms. You act like I got into my dream school.

134
00:10:01,916 --> 00:10:05,583
Your dad said the gambling house has been doing great.

135
00:10:05,666 --> 00:10:08,416
He suddenly gave me over 100 grand. God knows from where.

136
00:10:08,916 --> 00:10:10,416
I've been lucky lately.

137
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:12,958
And the gambling house is packed.

138
00:10:13,041 --> 00:10:14,583
I'm too busy to even call you.

139
00:10:14,666 --> 00:10:17,291
Really? If the business is that good, how about this?

140
00:10:17,375 --> 00:10:19,541
Help me stock up on seafood to sell?

141
00:10:19,625 --> 00:10:21,083
-Dad, what's wrong? -What?

142
00:10:21,166 --> 00:10:22,500
Why is your hand shaking?

143
00:10:22,583 --> 00:10:23,416
Is it?

144
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,083
An occupational injury.

145
00:10:25,166 --> 00:10:27,208
I shake the dice cup every day.

146
00:10:27,291 --> 00:10:29,541
It's become a reflex now. Give it a few days.

147
00:10:29,625 --> 00:10:30,791
I'm being serious here.

148
00:10:30,875 --> 00:10:33,375
Why don't you schedule a full health checkup?

149
00:10:33,458 --> 00:10:35,833
You know my customer, Old Hsiao?

150
00:10:35,916 --> 00:10:39,000
He recently did a checkup and was diagnosed with sarcopenia.

151
00:10:39,083 --> 00:10:40,458
He has trouble even walking.

152
00:10:40,541 --> 00:10:41,541
Are you crazy?

153
00:10:41,625 --> 00:10:44,208
That Old Hsiao is over 70 years old. Don't compare me to him.

154
00:10:44,291 --> 00:10:45,916
I'm worried about you.

155
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,333
Hey, don't let these two sit. We must finish them.

156
00:10:48,416 --> 00:10:49,875
We can box whatever's left.

157
00:10:49,958 --> 00:10:53,208
As if we need you to tell us. Also, this needs to be eaten first.

158
00:10:53,750 --> 00:10:55,541
All right, you're the smartest.

159
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,875
-Hey, eat more. -Okay.

160
00:10:57,958 --> 00:10:58,916
Keep it up next year.

161
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,375
Don't make it sound so easy.

162
00:11:00,458 --> 00:11:01,583
It's so easy for you.

163
00:11:01,666 --> 00:11:02,500
-No. -It is.

164
00:11:02,583 --> 00:11:04,000
I study a lot.

165
00:11:04,083 --> 00:11:05,208
You're my son.

166
00:11:12,416 --> 00:11:15,000
I just got raided a while ago. I've already done my best.

167
00:11:26,166 --> 00:11:27,583
Make up for it next time.

168
00:11:43,875 --> 00:11:44,958
Give it to me.

169
00:11:45,041 --> 00:11:46,708
Give it to me. Hurry up.

170
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:07,916
Found the phone yet?

171
00:12:09,666 --> 00:12:10,708
As if that's possible.

172
00:12:10,791 --> 00:12:12,250
You want me to go to the police?

173
00:12:13,083 --> 00:12:15,083
Of course not.

174
00:12:15,583 --> 00:12:18,791
I'm just wondering if there's any evidence of me on the phone.

175
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,666
What's this?

176
00:12:21,250 --> 00:12:22,958
I'm in trouble, and you make it about you?

177
00:12:27,041 --> 00:12:29,875
What are we? You think I'd only care about myself?

178
00:12:29,958 --> 00:12:32,500
We've worked together how long? Hasn't it been great?

179
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,125
I still need your help getting clients.

180
00:12:37,625 --> 00:12:40,416
Once things die down, it'll all be good, okay?

181
00:12:40,500 --> 00:12:43,333
The leak? Who the fuck cares, man? People will forget about it.

182
00:12:43,958 --> 00:12:45,291
That girl died.

183
00:12:45,833 --> 00:12:47,750
All the sponsors are pulling out.

184
00:12:48,250 --> 00:12:50,458
It's not just about the bad press, okay?

185
00:12:50,541 --> 00:12:52,500
That girl's death isn't your fault, okay?

186
00:12:52,583 --> 00:12:54,916
You only filmed it. You didn't distribute it, okay?

187
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,958
Whoever did that, hey, had a fucking conscience.

188
00:12:58,041 --> 00:12:59,833
They blurred her face.

189
00:13:03,791 --> 00:13:05,000
Do you have more?

190
00:13:05,083 --> 00:13:06,416
Give me some more.

191
00:13:14,916 --> 00:13:18,541
If cops question you, remember not to say my name.

192
00:13:27,250 --> 00:13:29,458
You've been doing this for over ten years.

193
00:13:29,541 --> 00:13:30,916
You still handle

194
00:13:31,875 --> 00:13:34,333
every case personally.

195
00:13:36,666 --> 00:13:40,166
This client went to Yeh Yueh Tong behind our back.

196
00:13:41,083 --> 00:13:42,625
Something feels off.

197
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:45,708
When you meet them later, keep an eye out.

198
00:13:47,833 --> 00:13:49,541
If Fixer Lunar knew

199
00:13:49,625 --> 00:13:52,541
that you weren't coming and were only sending me,

200
00:13:53,333 --> 00:13:55,875
she would feel insulted.

201
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:59,083
You've been with Ching He the longest.

202
00:13:59,166 --> 00:14:00,625
You have the most seniority.

203
00:14:01,125 --> 00:14:02,958
Why should she feel insulted?

204
00:14:03,041 --> 00:14:05,750
Besides, you still call her Fixer Lunar.

205
00:14:06,250 --> 00:14:08,208
That is showing her plenty of respect.

206
00:14:09,083 --> 00:14:11,125
After such a long time, I've gotten used to it.

207
00:14:11,625 --> 00:14:13,416
I mean nothing by it.

208
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,791
It's just like how sometimes, when I see you,

209
00:14:17,291 --> 00:14:20,166
the name Fixer Solar comes to mind.

210
00:14:26,916 --> 00:14:31,208
I didn't know the rules between you two, so I hired both of you.

211
00:14:31,791 --> 00:14:33,000
It's okay.

212
00:14:34,041 --> 00:14:36,041
I know you love your daughter dearly.

213
00:14:37,041 --> 00:14:40,083
There is always an order to things.

214
00:14:40,875 --> 00:14:42,000
Prosecutor, may I ask

215
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:45,416
who you commissioned first?

216
00:14:50,291 --> 00:14:51,166
Ching He.

217
00:14:53,125 --> 00:14:57,625
However, first doesn't always mean best.

218
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:01,375
That applies to cases and positions.

219
00:15:01,875 --> 00:15:03,791
Don't you agree, Sir Hong?

220
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:07,250
The videos filmed by those scumbags are starting to leak.

221
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:10,000
I don't know if my daughter's will be next.

222
00:15:10,875 --> 00:15:11,833
You said

223
00:15:12,625 --> 00:15:15,000
you'd handle it, even if you had to kill.

224
00:15:15,083 --> 00:15:17,291
I don't care if you're competitors.

225
00:15:17,375 --> 00:15:19,541
You got paid, so you have to get the job done.

226
00:15:19,625 --> 00:15:21,708
Work together or not,

227
00:15:21,791 --> 00:15:24,250
I just want my daughter to be safe.

228
00:15:25,416 --> 00:15:26,666
Please.

229
00:15:30,875 --> 00:15:34,583
Although Yeh Yueh Tong and Ching He have never worked together,

230
00:15:35,083 --> 00:15:37,083
if it means completing the job faster,

231
00:15:37,791 --> 00:15:39,333
I don't mind making an exception.

232
00:15:39,916 --> 00:15:42,958
The Tai account belongs to someone named Cho Wen-tai.

233
00:15:43,041 --> 00:15:45,833
He owns a nightclub called Ash.

234
00:15:47,166 --> 00:15:49,250
I restored a conversation between Sheng and him.

235
00:15:50,583 --> 00:15:54,041
Cho Wen-tai's been selling drugs to him. They mentioned many celebrities too.

236
00:15:54,125 --> 00:15:55,875
But this isn't even the craziest part.

237
00:15:55,958 --> 00:15:59,958
Sheng would bring Cho Wen-tai girls to drug at the nightclub.

238
00:16:00,041 --> 00:16:02,625
Seems like this is just the tip of the iceberg.

239
00:16:28,291 --> 00:16:29,916
Before we continue,

240
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,750
something needs to be clarified.

241
00:16:34,041 --> 00:16:36,000
Ching He just found out

242
00:16:37,125 --> 00:16:39,000
that three years ago, your daughter

243
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:42,083
was hospitalized after falling into a coma.

244
00:16:42,583 --> 00:16:46,125
It was impossible for her to have filmed a video with Sheng.

245
00:16:47,666 --> 00:16:52,208
Ms. Yen, what exactly is the purpose of this job?

246
00:17:01,541 --> 00:17:03,166
Here to investigate Cho Wen-tai too?

247
00:17:04,208 --> 00:17:05,458
Give it back to me.

248
00:17:06,625 --> 00:17:09,500
Did you come for the case or your thing?

249
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:11,708
Both.

250
00:17:13,416 --> 00:17:15,000
You should've told me then.

251
00:17:15,083 --> 00:17:17,000
Too bad I didn't bring it.

252
00:17:19,958 --> 00:17:22,666
Why don't you tell me how you'll approach Cho Wen-tai?

253
00:17:23,166 --> 00:17:25,083
The same way you approached Sheng?

254
00:17:27,458 --> 00:17:28,333
Mission canceled.

255
00:17:42,041 --> 00:17:43,875
SIR HONG: MISSION CANCELED

256
00:17:48,708 --> 00:17:50,250
The job has been canceled.

257
00:17:50,333 --> 00:17:51,416
Stand down.

258
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:52,333
Why?

259
00:17:52,833 --> 00:17:54,375
The client lied.

260
00:17:55,125 --> 00:17:57,416
Her target is Cho Wen-tai.

261
00:17:58,916 --> 00:18:01,750
Cho Wen-tai sells drugs and colludes with scumbags like Sheng

262
00:18:01,833 --> 00:18:03,875
to drug and rape girls.

263
00:18:04,375 --> 00:18:06,541
But he's always released for lack of evidence.

264
00:18:06,625 --> 00:18:07,500
Tai.

265
00:18:09,458 --> 00:18:12,916
There's even pressure from higher-ups to stop investigating.

266
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:16,041
Did you see that chick with her hair in buns dancing wildly?

267
00:18:16,125 --> 00:18:17,333
Oh, yes.

268
00:18:17,416 --> 00:18:18,958
Take her to the VIP room.

269
00:18:19,041 --> 00:18:19,875
Okay.

270
00:18:19,958 --> 00:18:21,333
-Hey. -So…

271
00:18:21,416 --> 00:18:22,833
Not the two ugly ones.

272
00:18:22,916 --> 00:18:26,083
…your goal is to make us investigate Cho Wen-tai,

273
