not delete the videos.

274
00:18:28,791 --> 00:18:29,666
Am I correct?

275
00:18:32,333 --> 00:18:34,916
These people hurt my daughter.

276
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:37,833
I can't let them go unpunished.

277
00:18:38,333 --> 00:18:42,291
Using both Yeh Yueh Tong and Ching He to do your policing.

278
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,625
How amusing.

279
00:18:45,458 --> 00:18:49,333
Ching He is canceling this job right now.

280
00:18:49,916 --> 00:18:51,791
You will be fully refunded.

281
