Didn't you also see

282
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:57,750
what Cho Wen-tai did?

283
00:18:58,250 --> 00:19:02,375
Fixers aren't your tools for solving cases.

284
00:19:02,458 --> 00:19:04,750
No matter how atrocious Cho Wen-tai's actions are,

285
00:19:05,666 --> 00:19:07,666
they have nothing to do with us.

286
00:19:07,750 --> 00:19:09,875
Since Ching He is pulling out,

287
00:19:10,541 --> 00:19:11,625
I'm pulling out too.

288
00:19:12,125 --> 00:19:13,958
I don't take cases they don't want.

289
00:19:19,458 --> 00:19:21,000
You posted

290
00:19:21,833 --> 00:19:24,000
