294
00:19:41,833 --> 00:19:43,333
No one would've known.

295
00:19:43,416 --> 00:19:45,000
And no one would've cared.

296
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:46,500
Do you think

297
00:19:47,083 --> 00:19:49,291
