305
00:20:16,875 --> 00:20:20,125
Whatever you do next will be on you.

306
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:42,958
-Hello? -Done with dinner?

307
00:20:43,041 --> 00:20:44,958
Obviously. Look at the time.

308
00:20:45,041 --> 00:20:46,875
Come to the address I sent you.

309
00:20:46,958 --> 00:20:49,250
And remember every single word I say next.

310
00:20:49,333 --> 00:20:51,083
Dad, what are you doing?

311
00:20:51,583 --> 00:20:53,666
