314
00:20:56,875 --> 00:20:58,958
The unified exam is coming up. I have no time.

315
00:21:00,375 --> 00:21:04,208
Bud, if you keep this up, your body will give out in half a year.

316
00:21:04,291 --> 00:21:05,625
Yours is the one giving out.

317
00:21:05,708 --> 00:21:08,666
Mom told you to get a checkup, and you keep stalling.

318
00:21:09,625 --> 00:21:11,750
The time has come.

319
00:21:11,833 --> 00:21:14,125
Your old man has to take a dump.

320
00:21:15,083 --> 00:21:17,333
Finally, after being constipated for so long?

321
