345
00:23:10,958 --> 00:23:13,666
Eight million. Who exactly wants to kill me?

346
00:23:14,958 --> 00:23:16,208
Cho Wen-tai.

347
00:23:16,291 --> 00:23:17,541
Sheng.

348
00:23:17,625 --> 00:23:19,375
