351
00:23:22,666 --> 00:23:24,708
What sex videos? Are you crazy?

352
00:23:24,791 --> 00:23:25,916
What do you mean?

353
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,250
You're under scrutiny now.

354
00:23:27,333 --> 00:23:30,541
You might spill everything when the cops take you in.

355
00:23:30,625 --> 00:23:32,791
Bastard. Fucking kicking away the ladder?

356
