358
00:23:37,916 --> 00:23:40,541
Sorry, I'm just doing what I'm paid to do.

359
00:23:41,208 --> 00:23:42,208
Wait!

360
00:23:45,708 --> 00:23:47,875
I'll pay you double. Go kill him.

361
00:23:49,250 --> 00:23:51,000
