362
00:23:51,083 --> 00:23:52,375
I'll pay you ten million.

363
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:55,458
I don't care how Cho Wen-tai dies.

364
00:23:55,958 --> 00:23:57,583
Who did you say wants me dead? Sheng?

365
