374
00:24:28,875 --> 00:24:30,000
Fuck you, Cho Wen-tai!

375
00:24:33,458 --> 00:24:36,541
What? Fuck, are you kidding me? You're haggling now?

376
00:24:37,125 --> 00:24:38,250
Fuck, I'm out!

377
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:40,291
Fuck you!

378
00:24:41,041 --> 00:24:42,250
Not gonna touch you now.

379
