409
00:26:27,791 --> 00:26:30,708
Better to get on a brother's wrong side than a fixer's.

410
00:26:32,708 --> 00:26:34,916
By the way, how is Fixer Shadow doing now?

411
00:26:36,375 --> 00:26:38,041
You shot him. What do you think?

412
00:26:38,791 --> 00:26:41,166
All right. I'm really sorry.

413
00:26:41,666 --> 00:26:43,041
I'll apologize sometime, okay?

414
00:26:46,500 --> 00:26:48,208
