415
00:26:48,291 --> 00:26:51,833
Don't tell me you had nothing to do with them going at each other's throats.

416
00:26:52,333 --> 00:26:55,916
I just wanted to confirm that our plan could go smoothly.

417
00:26:56,958 --> 00:26:58,750
Although Cho Wen-tai is a scumbag,

418
