Hey, did you hear that?

423
00:27:12,166 --> 00:27:13,791
-Fixer Lucky. -Fixer Bottom.

424
00:27:13,875 --> 00:27:15,583
Did I pass my probationary period?

425
00:27:16,083 --> 00:27:17,458
Go home and rest first.

426
00:27:17,541 --> 00:27:19,291
When there is a new case,

427
00:27:19,375 --> 00:27:20,916
