Gerald Chen came to me for help.

447
00:28:42,750 --> 00:28:45,000
He barely spoke when he got a call and rushed off.

448
00:28:45,666 --> 00:28:47,166
I didn't hear from him afterward.

449
00:28:48,625 --> 00:28:49,791
Who called?

450
