479
00:31:11,083 --> 00:31:12,791
Fucking hell, ridiculous.

480
00:31:14,250 --> 00:31:15,166
Pin.

481
00:31:16,166 --> 00:31:17,750
You are a capable person,

482
00:31:18,250 --> 00:31:20,458
but capability alone isn't enough.

483
00:31:20,958 --> 00:31:21,875
Hsiu's experience

484
00:31:23,083 --> 00:31:25,416
