496
00:32:00,083 --> 00:32:01,333
How old are you guys?

497
00:32:01,833 --> 00:32:02,833
Who?

498
00:32:02,916 --> 00:32:04,000
Shit, it's boss.

499
00:32:05,750 --> 00:32:07,750
-Hello, boss. I'm 20. -Hello, boss. I'm 18.

500
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,583
Remember.

501
00:32:15,875 --> 00:32:17,541
The brothers you meet

502
00:32:17,625 --> 00:32:19,083
