503
00:32:19,583 --> 00:32:21,500
are your true brothers.

504
00:32:22,083 --> 00:32:24,458
Don't argue or fall out so easily.

505
00:32:24,958 --> 00:32:26,125
-Got it? -Okay.

506
00:32:26,625 --> 00:32:27,875
Boss, we'll see you out.

507
00:32:28,500 --> 00:32:29,875
Again with seeing me out?

508
00:32:31,166 --> 00:32:32,458
