509
00:32:32,958 --> 00:32:34,583
I'm dying, is that it?

510
00:32:34,666 --> 00:32:36,000
Everyone wants to see me out.

511
00:32:36,083 --> 00:32:37,000
No, boss.

512
00:32:37,583 --> 00:32:38,875
-Sorry, boss. -Sorry, boss.

513
00:33:24,875 --> 00:33:26,333
He should be a fixer too, right?

514
00:33:26,416 --> 00:33:27,458
Is he your partner?

515
00:33:27,541 --> 00:33:28,958
Let him go.

516
00:33:30,083 --> 00:33:31,083
Why should I,

517
00:33:31,916 --> 00:33:33,083
Mina Shen?

518
00:33:36,250 --> 00:33:39,416
"Mina Shen. Lost both parents at a young age."

519
00:33:40,458 --> 00:33:42,291
"Raised by an aunt, who ran a gambling den."

520
00:33:42,375 --> 00:33:43,375
Are you blind?

521
00:33:43,458 --> 00:33:45,083
"Consistently excelled at school."

522
00:33:45,833 --> 00:33:47,708
"Studied chemical engineering." Goodness.

523
00:33:47,791 --> 00:33:49,500
You were a top student.

524
00:33:53,458 --> 00:33:54,666
I don't need you

525
00:33:55,166 --> 00:33:56,166
