Fuck. Ching He discovered your identity.

542
00:34:48,583 --> 00:34:50,291
-If Yeh Yueh Tong knows-- -It's fine.

543
00:34:50,791 --> 00:34:52,041
This is a personal feud.

544
00:34:55,166 --> 00:34:57,791
I say, you should stop investigating.

545
00:34:58,291 --> 00:35:00,125
If Gerald doesn't want to be found,

546
00:35:00,208 --> 00:35:02,375
no amount of searching will help.

547
00:35:03,750 --> 00:35:04,916
I have a feeling

548
00:35:05,500 --> 00:35:06,958
I will find him soon.

549
00:35:11,916 --> 00:35:12,916
I have to go.

550
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,375
Already? In such a rush?

551
00:35:14,875 --> 00:35:15,791
Apply your ointment.

552
00:35:16,291 --> 00:35:19,125
Gosh, young people these days…

553
00:35:19,625 --> 00:35:20,875
What a mess.

554
00:35:21,458 --> 00:35:23,291
Damn, if I weren't crippled,

555
00:35:23,375 --> 00:35:25,166
that fellow would've been on the floor.

556
00:35:25,958 --> 00:35:26,833
At least

557
00:35:27,333 --> 00:35:28,791
I got some US dollars.

558
00:35:54,333 --> 00:35:55,916
Make a sound, and you will die.

559
00:35:58,541 --> 00:35:59,416
Give me the phone.

560
00:36:09,791 --> 00:36:11,083
I don't want to kill you.

561
00:36:11,958 --> 00:36:12,916
But he will.

562
00:36:15,125 --> 00:36:16,791
I'm going to lower the knife.

563
00:36:17,291 --> 00:36:18,875
Just leave quietly.

564
00:36:19,375 --> 00:36:20,500
You didn't see anything.

565
00:36:22,333 --> 00:36:23,958
If you run your mouth,

566
00:36:24,041 --> 00:36:26,958
I'll use this phone to find you and your family.

567
00:36:27,708 --> 00:36:29,666
You won't be the only one in trouble.

568
00:36:50,208 --> 00:36:51,083
Thank you.

569
00:36:52,125 --> 00:36:55,000
Where do you want the body this time?

570
00:36:55,083 --> 00:36:56,750
Put it in that woman's room.

571
00:36:57,250 --> 00:37:00,083
When she wakes up and sees it, she'll spill everything.

572
00:37:00,583 --> 00:37:03,166
Nah. I gotta say this even if we're buds.

573
00:37:03,250 --> 00:37:04,750
I'm charging this time.

574
00:37:04,833 --> 00:37:07,625
This is turning into your body disposal plant.

575
00:37:08,583 --> 00:37:12,416
Is Yeh Yueh Tong paying you too little? Should I talk to Madam Fan?

576
00:37:12,500 --> 00:37:13,791
Fuck you.

577
00:37:13,875 --> 00:37:15,791
Do you want me to die?

578
00:37:16,416 --> 00:37:17,333
Let's get going.

579
00:37:17,416 --> 00:37:18,666
Give me back my phone.

580
00:37:29,708 --> 00:37:31,333
Lower your gun. I'll handle it.

581
00:37:37,416 --> 00:37:38,875
If I lose my phone,

582
00:37:40,375 --> 00:37:41,958
I'll be beaten to death.

583
00:37:53,041 --> 00:37:54,333
What did you see earlier?

584
00:37:57,958 --> 00:37:59,375
You borrowed my phone

585
00:38:00,291 --> 00:38:01,541
and forgot to return it.

586
00:38:01,625 --> 00:38:02,541
So I came for it.

587
00:38:03,208 --> 00:38:04,833
I didn't see anything else.

588
00:38:08,500 --> 00:38:10,291
If I give you back your phone,

589
00:38:10,791 --> 00:38:13,083
how do I know that you won't recall something?

590
00:38:16,375 --> 00:38:17,458
By the alley,

591
00:38:17,958 --> 00:38:19,333
there are tokens and blood.

592
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:21,125
Don't forget them.

593
00:38:21,625 --> 00:38:23,166
Hold it up so I can see it better.

594
00:38:39,125 --> 00:38:40,208
How old are you?

595
00:38:40,708 --> 00:38:41,541
Sixteen.

596
00:38:44,958 --> 00:38:46,500
What were you doing at 16?

597
00:38:46,583 --> 00:38:47,500
At 16?

598
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:49,875
-I don't even remember 36. -Teach me.

599
00:38:51,791 --> 00:38:52,833
Teach me how to shoot.

600
00:38:54,208 --> 00:38:55,875
Do you know what we do?

601
00:39:02,916 --> 00:39:04,666
You're gonna use the body in the trunk

602
00:39:05,166 --> 00:39:06,583
to threaten someone.

603
00:39:06,666 --> 00:39:08,583
Didn't you say you saw nothing?

604
00:39:09,583 --> 00:39:11,583
If I become an accomplice,

605
00:39:12,458 --> 00:39:14,250
it won't matter whether I saw anything.

606
00:39:15,041 --> 00:39:15,958
Right?

607
00:39:21,666 --> 00:39:24,041
The girl is quite a natural.

608
00:39:28,333 --> 00:39:30,000
Clean up the blood you saw.

609
00:39:56,750 --> 00:39:58,000
Are you gonna talk?

610
00:39:59,541 --> 00:40:01,291
Gerald Chen came to me for help.

611
00:40:01,875 --> 00:40:03,916
He barely spoke when he got a call and rushed off.

612
00:40:04,416 --> 00:40:05,458
Who called?

613
00:40:05,958 --> 00:40:07,500
It was San He's boss,

614
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,000
Lin Wan-li.

615
00:40:15,625 --> 00:40:16,791
Hello?

616
00:40:17,375 --> 00:40:18,416
My beautiful wife.

617
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:20,875
I just bought food and am heading home.

618
00:40:20,958 --> 00:40:22,666
Should I get anything for you?

619
00:40:23,750 --> 00:40:25,083
Okay.

620
00:44:48,583 --> 00:44:51,375
Subtitle translation by:
